ocs/site/durable-workflows/streams.md`](file:///home/codex/repos/ns004-docs/docs/site/durable-workflows/streams.md) noting `STREAMS_DATA_DIR` defaults to in-memory non-durable storage and naming `STREAMS_DATA_DIR=\u003cpath\u003e` as the durable setting.\n3. **2c — Pure helper \u0026 startup log**: Extracted [`describeStorageDurability`](file:///home/codex/repos/ns004-docs/plugins/streams/services/src/durability.ts), unit-tested both branches in [`durability_test.ts`](file:///home/codex/repos/ns004-docs/plugins/streams/services/src/durability_test.ts), and called it from [`main.ts`](file:///home/codex/repos/ns004-docs/plugins/streams/services/src/main.ts) to log a startup warning when `STREAMS_DATA_DIR` is unset.\n\n#### Verification Evidence:\n\n1. **Unit Test (`deno test plugins/streams/services/src/durability_test.ts`)**:\n```text\nrunning 2 tests from ./plugins/streams/services/src/durability_test.ts\ndescribeStorageDurability: file-backed durable branch ... ok (363µs)\ndescribeStorageDurability: in-memory non-durable branch ... ok (82µs)\n\nok | 2 passed | 0 failed (6ms)\n```\n\n2. **Slice 2 Gates**:\n- `deno run --allow-read --allow-run .llm/tools/run-deno-check.ts --root plugins/streams --ext ts,tsx`: PASS (49 files)\n- `deno run --allow-read --allow-run .llm/tools/run-deno-lint.ts --root plugins/streams --ext ts,tsx`: PASS (49 files)\n- `deno run --allow-read --allow-run .llm/tools/run-deno-fmt.ts --root plugins/streams --ext ts,tsx`: PASS (49 files)\n\n**Slice 2 Commit**: `8eb40ef90` (`docs(streams): surface the stream path prefix and the non-durable default`, `Refs #1020`)\n\n---\n\n### Final Validation Gates\n\n```text\ndeno task docs:links    -\u003e 0 broken links, 0 broken anchors\ndeno task docs:accuracy -\u003e PASS (4 saga pages, 8 preferred paths, 18 CLI mutation families)\ndeno task quality:scan  -\u003e {\"ok\":true,\"mode\":\"repository\",\"scanned\":[\"packages/cli/src\",\"plugins\"],\"findings\":[],\"allowCount\":7}\n```\n","duration_seconds":